   "fix": "Add tests against the exported functions for fixed field positions, amount alignment and overflow, supported dates, and unchanged CSV output."
  },
  {
   "title": "Use the runtime padding operation instead of a custom loop",
   "severity": "P3",
   "location": "export.ts:21-24",
   "failure": "Indirection Tax: padLeft reimplements String.prototype.padStart for its only caller without adding a capability. The custom helper adds a separate implementation to maintain. Runtime checks confirm padStart provides the required space padding, including negative amounts; it also requires the separate overflow check described above.",
   "fix": "Replace the helper call with formatAmount(tx.amountCents).padStart(AMOUNT_WIDTH, \" \") and delete padLeft."
