- P2 | checkout-page.ts:8-11, search-page.ts:3-4 | Missing behavioral tests for the gate migration and new express-shipping option. The supplied project contains no tests for either page, so regressions in flag names, user ID forwarding, disabled flags, or independent checkout options are not detected. Add tests using a real FlagStore and FeatureGate, covering enabled and disabled flags and both checkout options independently.

